while r22 -> L3 else L0 stages [L2, L3, L4]
// L2: cycle Storage(r23)+Control in_order {ref, call next, test_variant, while}
// L3: free {unwrap_variant, assign, ref, call to_string}
// L4: cycle Storage(r24) in_order law(Fold(r24, #7) exact) {ref, call push}
// control chained through L2
// cost in place: no count on entry
// lower in place: it is a pull loop
for slice(r4) -> L1 else L2 stages [L1, L5, L6, L7]
// L1: free {as_slice, call from_str, test_variant}
// L5: cycle Control in_order {branch}
// L6: free {unwrap_variant}
// L7: cycle Storage(r5) in_order law(Fold(r5, #7) exact) {ref, call push}
// control chained through L5
// cost W=8 O=18293 split when n > 73172, n ≤ len(r4)
// lower in place: its first stage spawns no heavy or io call before it waits
